          "text": "Témoignages: HAVRE (LE) (76) 15.12.2006 T1 HAVRE (LE) (76) 15.12.2006 T2 HAVRE (LE) (76) 15.12.2006 T3",
          "text_sha256": "fca4423ea759825ecf3827ea7c33c65317a50e274aa74c9bad43d03e0bd711c6"
        },
        {
